With war raging and the planet under siege by the armies of greedy Ork warlord Gorgutz, ambitious Eldar seer Macha, and mighty Space Marine commander Gabriel Angelos, supremacy must ultimately be suspended for survival.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-dawn-of-war-iii', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.01, '2026-08-05 03:13:48', '2026-08-05 03:13:48');
